check_theory — implementation plan
===================================

status: done (2026-07-10)

wave 2, scala-side (see plans/load_theory). the RE-VERIFICATION tool —
step 7 of the spec's proving workflow: the client spliced repl_text
into the file on disk; check_theory re-reads that file and reports.
the one hard requirement (spec, verbatim): PURGE BEFORE RE-LOADING,
because use_theories against a still-loaded node would report the
stale snapshot, not the edited file.

